न चातिस्वप्‍नशीलस्य जाग्रतो नैव चार्जुन ॥ १६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1858,\"bb\":1643,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/16/b1643/\",\"body_value\":\"nāty-aśnatas tu yogo ’sti
na caikāntam anaśnataḥ
